Great story, loyal to the original RPG mechanics, very good graphics, it worth every $$$.
Pros:
+ story;
+ alternative game play / non linear solutions for the puzzles;
+ game editor;
Cons:
- 2D game play in a 3D environment;
If you like an RPG, buy it. It woth every $$$.

