Although I think it's a fantastic horror game, I don't think I will be able to play it to the end.
+ The graphics are fine for a game from 2008;
+ Love the fact that you can upgrade stuff (such as health and weapons);
+ Another thing that I like, it's the slow motion effect (it helps a lot when the mutant creatures run into you);
+ Super creepy soundtrack which makes you live intense every moment of your gameplay;
- The mouse sensitivity it's a bit weird but you get used to it after a while.
In other words, the game is worth the money!

